{"id":"steam-1349910","steam":1349910,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Book of Sophia","summary":"Book of Sophia is an action adventure with roguelite elements. Follow the dungeon crawling journey of Sophia to discover the secrets of the book and the mysterious world.","about":"Book of Sophia is a fast-paced action adventure game with roguelike elements. As the protagonist of the Book of Sophia, you'll pick up your sword and bow to break free from the mysterious world of darkness.\r\n\r\n\r\n\nGAMEPLAY\n\r\n\n• Battle your way by defeating enemies with a combinations of skills and equipments.\r\n• Escape from a mix of procedurally generated levels and handcrafted scenes. A new challenge for every run.\r\n• Choose your next rewards from a diverse selection of power-ups and enchantments to develop a unique combat strategy.\r\n• Unlock new skills permanently. Start a new run and develop character for your playstyle, give yourself a better chance to escape from the Book.\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nFEATURES\n\r\n\n• Fast-paced sword and bow combat\r\n• Learn and use 20+ skills to fight with your own playstyle\r\n• 3 levels with various atmosphere, procedurally generated maps together with beautifully crafted scenes\r\n• Full gamepad support","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349910/library_600x900.jpg?t=1608805230","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349910/header.jpg?t=1608805230","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349910/library_hero.jpg?t=1608805230","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349910/header.jpg?t=1608805230","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349910/ss_699ba7a76be0d173210b716daa350bc167d12681.600x338.jpg?t=1608805230","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349910/ss_699ba7a76be0d1